msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"(What could Tamiya want with me? And who's that third party\r\n"
"he mentioned? I knew there was more to this than just some\r\n"
"internal Tojo Clan feud.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "(I should let Date-san know what's going on.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "What's the scoop, Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Date-san. I just got off the phone with Tamiya, the Minister\r\n"
"of Defense."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "What? Why would he want to talk to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"I wish I knew. Either way, it looks like someone from the\r\n"
"Tojo Clan is still pulling the strings in all this. Tamiya\r\n"
"also mentioned some kind of third party being involved."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"He asked me to come to the Diet Building to talk to him in\r\n"
"person. I'm about to head over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "To the Diet Building? How are you gonna get there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"He's sending a driver over. Apparently we're meeting in\r\n"
"front of the Millennium Tower."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Wait, Kiryu. Take me with you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "...Are you sure?"
msgstr "Mmm... sei sicuro?"

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Of course I'm sure! So, wanna meet up outside the Millennium\r\n"
"Tower?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"And risk making Tamiya's driver suspicious? Probably not\r\n"
"a good idea."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Let's head over there together, okay? Where are you now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "At Serena, as always. I'll see you out front."
msgstr ""

